      "writtenOn": "2023-10-23T18:09:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think you can rely on only one process to be in direct reclaim. So, direct_reclaim_state should be an `int` not a `bool` and maybe rename it into `procs_in_direct_reclaim`. In mm_vmscan_direct_reclaim_begin_probe you increment it and in mm_vmscan_direct_reclaim_end_probe you decrement it. The system is in direct reclaim if (procs_in_direct_reclaim \u003e 0).",
